    "body": "Sorry for dragging this out. I think I addressed all of the questions/issues. The main question outstanding right now is if the no-cors path using CORP is \"approved\" or if there are more steps to getting that integrated before this can land.\r\n\r\nI filed it as a [question with the TAG](https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/1203) but I'm happy do do a more formal review somewhere if necessary.",
